            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Gratuity equals Last Drawn Salary times 15 times Completed Years divided by 26. Last drawn salary means basic plus DA. Maximum Rs 20 lakh. Service over 6 months in final year rounded up."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Who is eligible for gratuity in Delhi?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Any employee completing 5 years continuous service in establishment with 10 plus employees. Fixed-term employees qualify after 1 year under new labour codes. Death or disablement no minimum service."
          }
