                <ul><li><strong>IT employee resigns after 8 years</strong> - Basic+DA Rs 60,000. (60,000 × 15 × 8) / 26 = Rs 2,76,923.</li><li><strong>Factory worker retires after 25 years</strong> - Basic+DA Rs 30,000. (30,000 × 15 × 25) / 26 = Rs 4,32,692.</li><li><strong>Manager with 10 years 7 months</strong> - Rounds to 11 years. Basic+DA Rs 80,000. (80,000 × 15 × 11) / 26 = Rs 5,07,692.</li><li><strong>Employee dies after 2 years</strong> - No 5-year requirement. Basic+DA Rs 40,000. (40,000 × 15 × 2) / 26 = Rs 46,154.</li><li><strong>High-salary 20 years</strong> - Formula gives Rs 23,07,692 but capped at Rs 20,00,000.</li></ul>

