<!-- SECTION 15A: LEGAL FRAMEWORK -->
<section class="content-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal Framework: Payment of Gratuity Act 1972</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>Governing Law:</strong> Payment of Gratuity Act, 1972 / Code on Social Security, 2020.</p><p><strong>Applicability:</strong> Establishments with 10+ employees. Once covered, always covered.</p><p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> 5 years continuous service. Death/disablement: no minimum. Fixed-term: 1 year pro-rata (new codes).</p><p><strong>Formula:</strong> (Last Drawn Salary × 15 × Years) / 26. Salary = basic + DA. Rounding: 6+ months = next year.</p><p><strong>Maximum:</strong> Rs 20 lakh (private). Rs 25 lakh (central government).</p><p><strong>Payment:</strong> Within 30 days. Interest: 10% p.a. on delay.</p><p><strong>Forfeiture:</strong> Only for moral turpitude, violence, riotous conduct.</p><p><strong>New Codes:</strong> Wages ≥50% CTC. Fixed-term pro-rata from 1 year.</p><p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://clc.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">clc.gov.in</a>, <a href="https://labour.delhi.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">labour.delhi.gov.in</a></p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

