                <p><strong>Gratuity ka formula kya hai?</strong> (Last Drawn Salary × 15 × Completed Years) / 26. Salary = Basic + DA. 15 din ka wage har saal. 26 working days month mein. Maximum Rs 20 lakh.</p><p><strong>Kitne saal baad milti hai?</strong> 5 saal continuous service. Death ya disability mein koi minimum nahi. Fixed-term employees ko naye code mein 1 saal baad pro-rata milti hai.</p><p><strong>30 din mein nahi di toh?</strong> 10% per annum interest. Employee Labour Commissioner ke paas complaint kar sakta hai.</p>

